  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-metalwork/assets/150550990/9b5a9711-dc60-4ca4-9ff3-250773771547\" alt=\"cmlogofixed2\"></p><h3><strong>关于</strong></h3><p>Create: Metalwork 是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 的一个附加模组，引入了新的流体和粉碎矿石，可用于增加每个矿石获得的锭的数量。该模组旨在与其他添加熔融金属和基于 Create 的锭处理模组无缝协作。</p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/AverageAnime/create-metalwork/wiki/Recipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">示例配方</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>当前内容</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>新的锭制作方式。产量高于原版熔炼！</li>\n<li>新的熔融矿石版本。</li>\n<li>新的粉碎矿石。</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>物品预览 (1.0.10)</strong></h3><p>Fabric/Forge:</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/537fb716-6505-44e5-8353-ca12748c4dd3\" alt=\"metalworkprevfabric\"></p><p>仅限 Forge:</p><p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/979ca042-1442-4ac2-9a21-3b530fd9b598\" alt=\"metalworkprevforgeitems\">\n<img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b8ad233e-97b6-4878-82d7-f83779b14e1f\" alt=\"metalworkprevforgefluids\"></p><h3><strong>支持的模组</strong></h3><p><em>注意：在 1.0.10 版本中，Fabric 内容通过 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sinytra-connector\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Sinytra Connector</a> 在 Forge 上得到支持。</em></p><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ad-astra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ad Astra</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betterend\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better End</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/betternether\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Nether</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/caverns-and-chasms\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caverns &amp; Chasms</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-creating-space\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Creating Space</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-big-cannons\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Big Cannons</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-dreams-desires\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Dreams &amp; Desires</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-ironworks\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Ironworks</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-metallurgy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Metallurgy</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-molten-metals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Molten Metals</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-northstar\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Northstar</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-simple-ore-doubling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Simple Ore Doubling</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-industry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: The Factory Must Grow</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/galosphere\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Galosphere</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/industrial-revolution\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Revolution</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mythicmetals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mythic Metals</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreganized\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized</a> [Forge]</li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252foreganized-refabricated\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreganized Refabricated</a> [Fabric]</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/liquid-burner\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Liquid Burner</a> [Fabric/Forge]</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>模组推荐：</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/almost-unified\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Almost United</a> - 统一配方以减少物品重叠。</li>\n</ul><h3><strong>我的其他模组</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-engineers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Engineers</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-food\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create: Food</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-chefs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Chefs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/rune-essence\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Rune Essence</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/stack-size-edit-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Stack Size Edit</a></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>致谢</strong></h3><ul>\n<li>基础代码来自 <a href=\"https://github.com/Tutorials-By-Kaupenjoe/Fabric-Tutorial-1.20.X\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tutorials By Kaupenjoe</a>。</li>\n<li>流体代码来自 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/delightful-creators-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delightful Creators</a>，作者为 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/flomik\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Flomik</a>。</li>\n<li>部分物品纹理基于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 中的资源。</li>\n<li>流体纹理基于 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-fabric\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create</a> 中的资源。</li>\n</ul>",
